  "title": "",
  "body": "  The flash unit in a camera uses a 3.00 V battery to charge a capacitor. The capacitor is then discharged through a flashlamp. The discharge takes 10.0μs, and the average power dissipated in the flashlamp is 10.0 W. What is the capacitance of the capacitor?   "
