  "body": "  P5. As part of your summer job as a design engineer at an electronics company, you have been asked to inspect the circuit shown below. The resistors are rated at 0.5 Watts, which means they burn-up if more than 0.5 Watts of power passes through them. Will the 100Ω resistor in the circuit burn up? Assume all values are good to 3 sig. figs.   replacement tag   replacement tag     "
