  "type": "Exercise",
  "number": "14.2.9",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  A proton moves in the magnetic field B = \\langle 0.52,0,0 \\rangle T with a velocity of 1.4×107 m\/s pointed in the negative y direction, as shown in the figure. What is the magnetic force vector on the proton? Give your answers in proper vector notation.   replacement tag   replacement tag     "
